DESCRIPTION:In the Provence region of France\, families celebrated the Yule
  season by displaying the nativity scene — and they got the idea of incl
 uding their townsfolk in the figures present at the adoration of the infan
 t Jesus — thus were created the “little Saints” of Provence — Les 
